<h2>Interface</h2>

<a href='{{ path(name = 'demo_form') }}' data-turbo-prefetch='false'>Les formulaires<a>

<h3>Boite de dialogue</h3>

    <button type="button" command="show-modal" commandfor="my-dialog" class="btn btn-primary">Open modal</button>

    <form method="post" action="{{ path('demo_dialog') }}">
        <button class="btn btn-primary">Ouvrir la boîte de dialogue</button>
    </form>

<h3>Session et cache applicatif</h3>
<form method="post"
        action="{{ path('demo_session') }}"
        data-turbo="false">
        <input type="hidden"
            name="_csrf_token"
            value="{{ csrf_token('demo_session') }}">
        <button class="btn">
            Session
        </button>
    </form>

<h3>Messenger</h3>

Démarrer la consommation des messages
Message log ne se retrouve pas dans Victoria Metrics mais dans la console du 2e processus

  <form method="post"
        action="{{ path('demo_messenger') }}"
        data-turbo="false">
        <input type="hidden"
            name="_csrf_token"
            value="{{ csrf_token('demo_messenger') }}">
        <button class="btn">
            Symfony Messenger
        </button>
    </form>

